'''Tails''' (テイルス, ''Teirusu'', '''Tails''') is a [[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating]] enemy that appears in the [[Sonic the Hedgehog Collaboration Event]]. He was added in [[Version 14.4 Update|Version 14.4]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Tails
|image = E 731.png
|first appearance = [[Sonic the Hedgehog Collaboration Event]]
|money drop = 2,000¢ - 7,900¢
}}

==Enemy==
For the most part, Tails serves as supportive sniper, whose high range, 50% [[Weaken]] and expansive [[Long Distance]] reach can impede units from afar, which is further compounded by his 100% [[Explosion]] that can greatly increase his damage. Fortunately, while he might be fast, he is very much reliant on his range and other enemies to keep him safe, due to having a small blindspot, low DPS and an easily exploitable trait.

